# Line-ending rules.
#
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise rewrite these to CRLF on the
# next checkout, and a bash script with CRLF line endings fails to run with
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M". Pin them to LF on every platform.
#
# Deliberately scoped: no global `* text=auto` line, so adding this file does
# not renormalise every other file in the repo.

*.sh        text eol=lf
hooks/*     text eol=lf
